-names>JD</given-names></name><name><surname>Heineman</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Robison</surname><given-names>LL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Parental exposure to hydrocarbons and risk of acute lymphocytic leukaemia in offspring</article-title><source>Cancer Epidemiol Biomarkers Prev</source><year>1999</year><volume>8</volume><fpage>783</fpage><lpage>791</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Cancer Epidemiol Biomarkers Prev||8|783||bib23|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10498397</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib24"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Simpson</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Cossey</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Diamond</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>1991 population estimates for areas smaller than districts</article-title><source>Popul Trends</source><year>1991</year><volume>90</volume><fpage>31</fpage><lpage>39</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Popul Trends||90|31||bib24|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9449158</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib25"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Simpson</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Diamond</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Tonkin</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Tye</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Updating small area population estimates in England and Wales</article-title><source>J Stat Soc A</source><year>1996</year><volume>159</volume><fpage>235</fpage><lpage>247</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Stat Soc A||159|235||bib25|'--></citation></ref><ref id="bib26"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Stiller</surname><given-names>CA</given-names></name><name><surname>Boyle</surname><given-names>PJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Effect of population mixing and socioeconomic status in England and Wales, 1979&#x02013;1985, on lymphoblastic leukaemia in children</article-title><source>BMJ</source><year>1996</year><volume>313</volume><fpage>1297</fpage><lpage>1300</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'BMJ||313|1297||bib26|'--></citation></ref><ref id="bib27"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Stiller</surname><given-names>CA</given-names></name><name><surname>O&#x02019;Connor</surname><given-names>CM</given-names></name><name><surname>Vincent</surname><given-names>TJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Draper</surname><given-names>GJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The National Registry of Childhood Tumours and the leukaemia&#x0002f;lymphoma data for 1966&#x02013;1983</article-title><source>The Geographical Epidemiology of Childhood Leukaemia and Non Hodgkin Lymphomas in Great Britain 1966&#x02013;1983</source><year>1993</year><publisher-name>London, HMSO</publisher-name><fpage>7</fpage><lpage>16</lpage>Draper GJ. (ed)Studies on Medical and Population Subjects, No. 53</citation></ref><ref id="bib28"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Swaen</surname><given-names>GMH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Review of the article by Knox: leukaemia clusters in childhood</article-title><source>J Epidemiol Commun Health</source><year>1996</year><volume>50</volume><fpage>109</fpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Epidemiol Commun Health||50|109||bib28|'--></citation></ref><ref id="bib29"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Townsend</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Phillimore</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Beattie</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title/><source>Health and Deprivation: Inequality and the North</source><year>1988</year><publisher-name>London: Routledge</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="bib30"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wignall</surname><given-names>CJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title/><source>British Railway Maps and Gazetteer from 1830&#x02013;1981</source><year>1983</year><publisher-name>Oxford: Oxford Publishing Company</publisher-name></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>